#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:27
msgid "Playback repeat mode"
msgstr "Kuyaphinda okudlalayo"

#. Translators: Don't translate allowed values, just the description in the brackets
#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:29
msgid ""
"Value identifies whether to repeat or randomize playback through the "
"collection. Allowed values are: “none” (repeat and shuffle are off), “song” "
"(repeat current song), “all” (repeat playlist, no shuffle), “shuffle” "
"(shuffle playlist, presumes repeat all)."
msgstr ""
"Inani lithi uma kumele kuphindwe noma kuxovwe ukudlala eqoqweni. Amanani "
"avunyelwe: \"none\" (phinda nokuxova kucishiwe), \"song\" (phinda le ngoma), "
"\"all\" (phinda uhlu ungaxovi), \"shuffle\" (xovisa uhlu kuthiwa phinda "
"konke)."

#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:33
msgid "Enable ReplayGain"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-Replay Gain"

#. Translators: Don't translate allowed values, just the description in the brackets
#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:35
msgid ""
"Enables or disables ReplayGain for albums or track. Allowed values are: "
"“disabled” (disables replaygain), “album” (replaygain per album), “track” "
"(replaygain per track)."
msgstr ""
"Fushaya noma kucisha i-Replay Gain kumacwecwe neomculo. Amanani avunyelwe: "
"\"disabled\" (kucisha i-replaygain), \"album\" (i-replaygain ngecwecwe), "
"\"track\" (i-replaygain ngomculo)."

#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:39
msgid "Inhibit system suspend"
msgstr "Misa ukulaliswa kohlakahlelo"

#: data/org.gnome.Music.gschema.xml:40
msgid "Enables or disables inhibiting system suspend while playing music"
msgstr ""
"Kuvumela futhi kuvimba ukumiswa kokulaliswa kohlakakhlelo uma kudlalwa umculo"

